  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to purchase Project vehicle and costs related to repairs for CTP funded projects.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CTP is working with CDoR to implement Caritas Norway and UKAM projects in Yirol East.  The projects continue to meet protection needs through Gender Based Violence (GBV) case management, strengthening referral pathways and psychosocial support groups. Advocacy work on GBV issues and Women&#x2019;s Empowerment will continue to be strengthened through PSS groups, engaging key stakeholders.
The purchase of another project vehicle will support, and costs related to repairs will help to supplement existing vehicles and motorbikes to ease project implementation.</narrative>
  </description>
